PAPPL v1.4.12 changes made by the OpenPrinting retrofit Printer Application
rock recipes (ps-, hplip-, gutenprint- and ghostscript-printer-app,
rockcraft.yaml part "pappl", which applies them with perl one-liners):

- Raise PAPPL_MAX_VENDOR from 32 to 256: 32 vendor options are too few for
  some busy PPD files.
- Turn off log rotation (log_max_size = 0; the rock's edit targets the
  pre-1.4.12 field name logmaxsize): it does not work with the forked filter
  processes.
- Make the web interface's manual "Network Printer" use a "cups:socket://"
  device URI, because the retrofit apps disable PAPPL's own backends and use
  the CUPS backends through the "cups:" scheme.

